        <mxCell id="note" value="Ticket.category and Ticket.amount are purchase snapshots. Status strings: VALID / USED / CANCELLED; payments: SIMULATED_SUCCESS / SIMULATED_REFUNDED. Credentials and enabled flags are stored in MariaDB, not in User objects. Failed payments issue no ticket or receipt. Additional Ticket getters are omitted for readability. Hollow diamonds denote shared aggregation of reusable value objects; they do not claim automatic Java object deletion. Relation counts read source to target." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
