        <mxCell id="note" value="VenueArea is a physical section. Several areas may share a TicketType using its stable code. Stage and area coordinates use a 1000 × 700 logical canvas. Each area has at most 100 assigned seats; 12 areas permit at most 1200. Blocked cells become aisles / unavailable spaces. Custom ticket names and prices affect future purchases; old tickets retain snapshots. Legacy fallback pricing remains supported. Hollow diamonds denote shared aggregation of reusable value objects; they do not claim automatic Java object deletion. Relation counts read source to target." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
