        <mxCell id="note" value="OpenEventUI holds Session. SecurityService is stateless; successful login returns a Session and always clears temporary password chars. BookingRepository enforces atomic seat claims, historical ticket snapshots, ownership, structural locks, refunds and one-time check-in. Summary counts/totals are calculated in OpenEventUI from saved ticket and seat lists. No AccountRecord, BookingData or EventSummary classes are implemented. Hollow diamonds denote shared aggregation of reusable value objects; they do not claim automatic Java object deletion. Relation counts read source to target." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
